# Rendered dashboard output (regenerated by refresh_artifact_dashboard.py)
build/

# The artifact refresher's fingerprint of the last publish. Must be tracked —
# each cloud Routine firing starts from a fresh clone, so an untracked state
# file would read as "never published" and republish every single run, which is
# exactly the waste the gate exists to prevent. Holds no credentials: a content
# hash, row counts, and the public artifact URL. Overrides the *.json guard.
!.dashboard-state.json
